ad_for_edu

This product bundles a rule book for audio description of lecture recordings
(src/ad_for_edu/standard/resources/rules_for_slides.yaml). Several rules quote or
paraphrase short passages from published accessibility guidelines. Each quotation
is attributed in the rule's "citation" field, and the quoted text remains the
property of its publisher. The licence of this repository covers the rule book's
own wording, structure and annotations, and does not extend to the quoted passages.
